    {
      "title": "Why It Matters",
      "content": "The miniCTX benchmark addresses the gap between the evaluation of current language model-based provers and the complexity of real-world theorem proving. It <strong>drives the development of methods that understand and work with context</strong> in complex, real-world theorem proving tasks. The results highlight the importance of providing models with rich contextual information beyond the immediate proof state.",
