      "title": "Try It Yourself",
      "content": "The miniCTX benchmark and evaluation code are open-sourced, allowing users to reconstruct the complete context for each theorem and evaluate their own models. The <strong>NTP-TOOLKIT</strong> provides a Python wrapper for the Lean Read-Eval-Print Loop (REPL) and enables simpler evaluation on the miniCTX benchmark.",
